\newlabel{fig:pareto_frontier}{{5}{15}{\textbf {Strategic Trade-off Analysis (Pareto Frontier).} Contrasting Baseline ($N=1,000$) vs. Expanded ($N=5,000$) scenarios. The "Expanded" scenario reveals a convex Pareto frontier. A Hybrid Strategy ($\alpha \approx 0.8$) creates a "Fast Track" option, reducing completion time by $\sim $33\% at the cost of higher risk ($J$)}{figure.caption.8}{}}
